   "body": "Thank you! While this is straight-forward to implement, I have always had 2 major concerns why I didn't implement this:\r\n* what is the effect of blending other background colors with the theme defined background for tokens? How does selection, find matches, word highglights, etc. look like when the theme defines such a background color\r\n* which of the top 20 most used themes define background colors for tokens? if we are to begin respecting now the tokens background tokens, most users will be surprised and they will interpret this as a breaking change; with the previous vscode version their code looked one way, they did nothing, and now the code has certain (unexpected) background colors.",
